              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyie ũla nĩ mũnini kwĩ ũla mũnini mbee kati wa atheu onthe, nĩnanengiwe mumo ũũ, kũtavan’ya kwa Andũ‐ma‐mbaĩ‐ingĩ ũthwii wa Klĩsto ũla ũtatalĩka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.8",
